      ],
      "en": "In that hour the disciples came to Jesus, saying, “Who then is greatest in the Kingdom of Heaven?”",
      "ko": "그 때에 제자들이 예수께 나아와 가로되 천국에서는 누가 크니이까",
      "source_text_hash": "9ee9ec28638263233f9ad923473eb84eadb6a380901b7d34a378b8ea513368a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "0f5004a09a64150703437655c149595448eb744c62bc47e472cf3a06533ff8f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 때에 제자들이 예수께 나아와 가로되 천국에서는 누가 크니이까"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0f5004a09a64150703437655c149595448eb744c62bc47e472cf3a06533ff8f0"
      ]
    },
    {
