      "en": "Then Peter came and said to him, “Lord, how often shall my brother sin against me, and I forgive him? Until seven times?”",
      "ko": "그 때에 베드로가 나아와 가로되 주여 형제가 내게 죄를 범하면 몇번이나 용서하여 주리이까 일곱번까지 하오리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "75688441360570a885d26517d3a65c16b0227598c2d4c789c2b0d7c72299e68f",
      "translation_text_hash": "23718f9be4656dcf34d96f242e08a23021dff19e2e72a0e4352856973ee12d25",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
